{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DB7ACg7XHr1794475973.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>韓國男團BIG BANG明日起在香港舉行演唱會，警方指有騙徒透過訛稱有門票出售等騙財。<br/></p><p>警方指有騙徒近日在社交平台冒充多間實體店，企圖增加可信性，之後訛稱有大量門票「原價贈出」、「贈飛多出」，誘騙市民先支付訂金，其後以「系統出錯」、「追加保證金」等，要求多次轉帳，之後失去蹤影。騙徒又會聲稱免費派發應援物，然後用同樣手法詐騙。</p><p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.MONEY-1700_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026f20YmllxC31794475983.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><br/></p><p>另外，警方亦搗破一個賣假門票集團，訛稱售賣足球球賽門票。兩次行動共拘捕10人，介乎18至46歲，涉及12宗騙案、騙款36萬元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:43:59.194007+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":227,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T09:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T11:29:09.651915+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T10:37:16.789544+00:00","content_hash":"6e666d75387e80aa9666ac5a9d857cf0c64e0e82230ae5e9c8f8af19e7650b76","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:43:59.194007+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}